<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第一幕 · 五层演变</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>五层是叠加，不是替代</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 620, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Box style={{height: 62, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "center", padding: "0 22px", borderRadius: 6, border: "1px dashed rgba(28,31,35,0.18)", background: "transparent"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)"}}>Graph</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>跨节点</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 62, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "center", padding: "0 22px", borderRadius: 6, border: "1px dashed rgba(28,31,35,0.18)", background: "transparent"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)"}}>Loop</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>跨运行</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 62, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "center", padding: "0 22px", borderRadius: 6, border: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.22)", background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.03)"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 22, color: "#1C1F23"}}>Harness</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>保障每一次执行</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 62, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "center", padding: "0 22px", borderRadius: 6, border: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.22)", background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.03)"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 22, color: "#1C1F23"}}>Context</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>服务一次模型调用</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 62, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "center", padding: "0 22px", borderRadius: 6, border: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.22)", background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.03)"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 22, color: "#1C1F23"}}>Prompt</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>服务一次模型调用</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 508, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>叠加，不是替代</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55}}>Prompt / Context 服务一次模型调用；Harness 保障每一次执行；Loop 跨运行；Graph 跨节点。</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", padding: 20, background: "rgba(138,90,0,0.07)", borderRadius: 8, marginTop: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>成熟度</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8}}>前三层成熟可信。Loop / Graph 是 2026 才冒头的新兴叙事、低置信度——不是既定范式。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>11 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
